title: Start
---
<<hide>>
<<show aiko left neutral>>
<<show ren right doubt>>
Aiko: Welcome to the old observatory. #line:obs_01 #voice:aiko_01
Ren: It is smaller than I pictured. #line:obs_02 #voice:ren_01
Aiko: Small, but the sky is the same size. #expr:smile #line:obs_03 #voice:aiko_02
The dome creaks open above them. #line:obs_04
-> Look through the telescope #line:obs_c1
    Aiko: Careful, the lens is older than both of us. #expr:worry #line:obs_05 #voice:aiko_03
    Ren: There, the ring around the moon. #expr:smile #line:obs_06 #voice:ren_02
-> Ask about the logbook #line:obs_c2
    Ren: Who kept this logbook? #at:center #line:obs_07 #voice:ren_03
    Aiko: My grandmother, every clear night for forty years. #expr:smile #line:obs_08 #voice:aiko_04
<<jump Tea>>
===
title: Tea
---
<<hide aiko>>
Aiko: Stay there, I will make some tea. #offstage #line:obs_09 #voice:aiko_05
Ren: I can see why she came back every night. #expr:smile #at:center #line:obs_10 #voice:ren_04
<<show aiko left smile>>
Aiko: Then come back tomorrow. #line:obs_11 #voice:aiko_06
-> Watch the scene again #line:obs_c3
    <<jump Start>>
-> Leave #line:obs_c4
    <<hide>>
    The observatory falls quiet. #line:obs_12
===
